  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Telecom Sector Modernization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The project&#xe2;&#x80;&#x99;s development objective is to promote the universal accessibility of a wide range of quality modern telecommunications services provided by multiple service providers in a well-regulated competitive environment, contributing to economic growth, competitiveness and social cohesion.   This will be achieved through:  a	the modernization of the legal, regulatory and institutional framework,  b	the introduction of fair competition and private participation,  c	the modernization of ICE, and  d	the promotion of investment in the provision of service to rural and isolated poor areas and vulnerable groups.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
